at reads them with `-I`. This does not apply to code the user asked you to build or run.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Computer\\Coding\\neathack\\SpeedRadar-NeetHack","sessionId":"3ac9aaf8-f1d5-4ab4-b5ac-62a9bdcabd6a","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"demo-video","slug":"calm-discovering-rabbit"}
